# um-texts 1
=== LITEM BansheeRobe00
Banshee cloak
Legend has it that such a cloak can protect you from ghosts.

=== LITEM BansheeRobe00_2
Big banshee cloak
Legend has it that banshee robes keep other ghosts away from your home.

=== LITEM BansheeRobe00_3
Very big banshee cloak
According to legend, this cloak can protect you from ghosts.

=== LITEM BansheeRobe01
Black banshee cloak
Legend has it that a banshee cloak keeps other ghosts away from your home.

=== LITEM BansheeRobe01_2
Strong black banshee cloak
Reliable protection from ghosts - if the rumour is correct, of  course.

=== LITEM BansheeRobe01_3
Veteran black banshee cloak
They say no ghost would ever come near close to the home where the owner of this cloak lives!

=== LITEM BansheeRune00
Banshee stone
They say this stone will protect a home from evil magic.

=== LITEM BansheeRune00_2
Strong banshee stone
They say this stone protects a home from evil magic.

=== LITEM BansheeRune00_3
Powerful banshee stone
They say this stone really can protect a home from evil magic.

=== LITEM BansheeRune01
Black banshee stone
Legend has it that this stone will protect your home from evil magic.

=== LITEM BansheeRune01_2
Strong black banshee stone
The legend says that this stone might really protect your home from evil magic.

=== LITEM BansheeRune01_3
Powerful black banshee stone
The legend has it that this stone will reliably protect your home from evil magic.

=== LITEM BatWings00
Wings of small bat
A provident man may find some uses for the wings' leather.

=== LITEM BatWings00_2
Bat wings
They can fetch you a few coins in the shop. Anything at all is useful.

=== LITEM BatWings00_3
Wings of large bat
Its leather has various domestic uses, so it can fetch you a few coins in the shop.

=== LITEM BatWings01
Wings of small fox-bat
They are always in demand, but the price is quite low.

=== LITEM BatWings01_2
Wings of fox-bat
You can sell them and make some money.

=== LITEM BatWings01_3
Wings of large fox-bat
Its leather has various domestic uses, so it can fetch you a few coins in the shop.

=== LITEM BatWings02
Wings of small black fox-bat
Its leather has various domestic uses, so it can fetch you a few coins in the shop.

=== LITEM BatWings02_2
Wings of black fox-bat
They say Witches buy them to make their potions...

=== LITEM BatWings02_3
Wings of large black fox-bat
They are always in demand by shopkeepers and Witches...

=== LITEM BeholderBigEye
Eye of small green evileye
The price will be in line with the product.

=== LITEM BeholderBigEye_2
Eye of young Green Evileye
They say the eye of Evileye brings luck, so you can always sell it.

=== LITEM BeholderBigEye_3
Eye of adult Green Evileye
No one really knows whether it is lucky or not... but it will bring money in, that's for sure!

=== LITEM BeholderEyes00
Eye of small Red Evileye
Not very expensive stuff, but still something.

=== LITEM BeholderEyes00_2
Eye of young Red Evileye
A valuable trophy - you are lucky!

=== LITEM BeholderEyes00_3
Eye of adult Red Evileye
There are always buyers for such large eyes!

=== LITEM BeholderEyes01
Small eye of Evileye cub
Small eye - small money.

=== LITEM BeholderEyes01_2
Eye of Evileye cub
It brings luck, but not a lot of it. Costs next-to-nothing as well...

=== LITEM BeholderEyes01_3
Large eye of Evileye cub
They say Evileye's eye brings luck, so how much luck will a cub's eye bring?

